      "content": "Life, uh, finds a way.",
      "authorName": "Dr. Ian Malcolm (Jeff Goldblum)",
      "source": "Jurassic Park (1993)",
      "sourceType": "movie",
      "quoteDate": "1993-06-11",
      "verificationStatus": "verified",
      "notes": "Malcolm's chaos theory observation. Goldblum's unique delivery made it memorable.",
