      "content": "I aim to misbehave.",
      "authorName": "Malcolm Reynolds (Nathan Fillion)",
      "source": "Serenity (2005)",
      "sourceType": "movie",
      "quoteDate": "2005-09-30",
      "verificationStatus": "verified",
      "notes": "Mal's defiant declaration. Firefly fans made it a rallying cry for the cancelled series.",
      "tags": [
        "dissent",
        "defiance",
        "one-liner"
