      "content": "How do you know if you want something yourself or if your upbringing programmed you to want it?",
      "authorName": "Trinity (Carrie-Anne Moss)",
      "source": "The Matrix Resurrections (2021)",
      "sourceType": "movie",
      "quoteDate": "2021-12-22",
      "verificationStatus": "verified",
      "notes": "Trinity (as 'Tiffany') mulling free will vs. conditioning during a coffee-shop conversation with Thomas Anderson.",
      "tags": [
        "authenticity",
        "identity",
